Bit API 
This API allows you to connect bots to our system. Telegram Bots are special accounts that do not require an additional phone
number to set up. These acccounts serve as an interface for code running somewhere on your server.

To use this, you don't need to know anything about how our MTProto encryption protocol works - our intermediary server will
handle all encryption and communication with the Telefram API for you. You communicate with this server via a simple HTTPS
interface that offers a simplefied version of the Telegram API.

